<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Morgan Stanley A.G. has issued 500'000 American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1750 CHF		  PREMIUM	10.03 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     13.15 CHF		 GEARING	13.0 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.OCT.98		 PAYDATE	09.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1710 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
